    "name": "Proverbs"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "usfm": "PRO.7",
    "human": "Proverbs 7",
    "previous": {
      "usfm": "PRO.6",
      "human": "Proverbs 6"
    },
    "next": {
      "usfm": "PRO.8",
      "human": "Proverbs 8"
    },
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My son, obey my words,",
          "and treasure my commands."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Keep my commands and live,",
          "and guard my instructions",
          "as you would the pupil of your eye."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Tie them to your fingers;",
          "write them on the tablet of your heart."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Say to wisdom, “You are my sister,”",
          "and call understanding your relative."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She will keep you from a forbidden woman,",
          "a wayward woman with her flattering talk."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Story of Seduction"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "At the window of my house",
          "I looked through my lattice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I saw among the inexperienced,",
          "I noticed among the youths,",
          "a young man lacking sense."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Crossing the street near her corner,",
          "he strolled down the road to her house"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "at twilight, in the evening,",
          "in the dark of the night."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A woman came to meet him",
          "dressed like a prostitute,",
          "having a hidden agenda."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She is loud and defiant;",
          "her feet do not stay at home."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Now in the street, now in the squares,",
          "she lurks at every corner."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She grabs him and kisses him;",
          "she brazenly says to him,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I’ve made fellowship offerings;",
          "today I’ve fulfilled my vows."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "So I came out to meet you,",
          "to search for you, and I’ve found you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I’ve spread coverings on my bed —",
          "richly colored linen from Egypt."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I’ve perfumed my bed",
          "with myrrh, aloes, and cinnamon."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Come, let’s drink deeply of lovemaking until morning.",
          "Let’s feast on each other’s love!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My husband isn’t home;",
          "he went on a long journey."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He took a bag of silver with him",
          "and will come home at the time of the full moon.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "She seduces him with her persistent pleading;",
          "she lures with her flattering talk."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He follows her impulsively",
          "like an ox going to the slaughter,",
          "like a deer bounding toward a trap"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "until an arrow pierces its liver,",
          "like a bird darting into a snare —",
          "he doesn’t know it will cost him his life."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Now, sons, listen to me,",
          "and pay attention to the words from my mouth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t let your heart turn aside to her ways;",
          "don’t stray onto her paths."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For she has brought many down to death;",
          "her victims are countless."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Her house is the road to Sheol,",
          "descending to the chambers of death."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
